faq:
  - q: How do partners send leads?
    a: Through their own portal login, using a lead form, instead of messages. Each lead arrives with the partner's details and notes and a status they can follow.
  - q: What stops two partners claiming the same customer?
    a: A partner lead is held at conversion if an active enquiry already exists on that phone number. Your team reviews it with the full history in front of them.
